# el++ engine fixture 14 (src/test.slop: ksc-fixture-at, test-ksc-entailments).
# 14. A nominal's class reaches every class equal to it: {a} ⊑ C, D ⊑ {a} ⊨ D ⊑ C,
# and a chain through a witness that is a: Q ⊑ ∃r.{a}, C ⊑ ∃s.D, r ∘ s ⊑ t, ∃t.D ⊑ E.
# Inside el++ whole: the engine must answer every class as the literal Psc
# reference does (test-ksc-engine-matches-reference).

@prefix : <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
:r a owl:ObjectProperty . :s a owl:ObjectProperty . :t a owl:ObjectProperty .
:C a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual . :b a owl:NamedIndividual .
:Q a owl:Class . :E a owl:Class .
[ owl:oneOf ( :a ) ] rdfs:subClassOf :C .
:D rdfs:subClassOf [ owl:oneOf ( :a ) ] .
:Q rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :r ; owl:hasValue :a ] .
:C rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :s ; owl:someValuesFrom :D ] .
:t owl:propertyChainAxiom ( :r :s ) .
[ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :t ; owl:someValuesFrom :D ] rdfs:subClassOf :E .
